<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it had issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance Co.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1450.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	14.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.05 SFR		  GEARING	11.30 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.NOV.96-17.APR.98   PAYDATE	15.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1376.00 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
